WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.190 line:90%,end
Nobody slept all night.

2
00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:06.030 line:90%,end
Everyone waited at the edge of the crevice where Eray had vanished.

3
00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.680 line:90%,end
I can't forgive myself for blaming him.

4
00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:15.290 line:90%,end
Just then, a blue light rose from the crevice. And the sound of singing.

5
00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.780 line:90%,end
Did you miss me? The creatures taught me a song. They sing terribly, though!

6
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:25.190 line:90%,end
Eray floated upward, laughing among the glowing creatures.

7
00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:27.180 line:90%,end
Sergeant was right behind him.

8
00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:31.370 line:90%,end
Eray! You little rascal! You scared us so much!

9
00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:34.780 line:90%,end
I'm sorry, Eray. We should have believed you.

10
00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:40.030 line:90%,end
It's okay. But next time you suspect me, bring chocolate first.

11
00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:45.470 line:90%,end
Everyone burst out laughing. But suddenly Pusula's light flickered.

12
00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:49.320 line:90%,end
In the hall beneath the fortress, capsule number four opened.

13
00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:52.140 line:90%,end
Someone is coming toward us. And very fast.

14
00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:55.790 line:90%,end
Everyone get ready. We have a guest tonight.

15
00:00:56.110 --> 00:00:58.910 line:90%,end
A red light flashed at the mouth of the tunnel.

16
00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:02.910 line:90%,end
A warrior in red armor walked ahead of the robots.

17
00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:06.990 line:90%,end
Stop right there. I am Nyra. Sila's red warrior.

18
00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:10.080 line:90%,end
Take one more step and I'll freeze you.

19
00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:12.480 line:90%,end
Go ahead and try, ice queen.

20
00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:17.000 line:90%,end
Mira's ice hit the armor, but it started melting at once.

21
00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:19.630 line:90%,end
Nyra's armor was hot as fire.

22
00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.320 line:90%,end
Shield up! Everyone behind me!

23
00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:24.720 line:90%,end
Leon, stay by my side!

24
00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:30.460 line:90%,end
The robots charged the shield. Eray called the creatures and the cave filled with light.

25
00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:33.240 line:90%,end
Come on, friends! It's showtime!

26
00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:38.790 line:90%,end
But Nyra's eyes were on one person only. On Aslı, standing at the edge of the shield.

27
00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:40.930 line:90%,end
Let me go! AyShe!

28
00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:46.720 line:90%,end
Nyra grabbed Aslı by the arm and vanished into a ring of red light.

29
00:01:47.020 --> 00:01:48.860 line:90%,end
Aslı! No!

30
00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:50.830 line:90%,end
But nobody noticed.

31
00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:56.250 line:90%,end
Just before the light faded, a small cat had jumped onto Nyra's cape.

32
00:01:56.650 --> 00:01:59.850 line:90%,end
Sergeant went with her. Aslı is not alone.

33
00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:05.450 line:90%,end
Did you see Nyra's eyes? She's not a robot. She woke from a capsule too.

34
00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:09.370 line:90%,end
Then we can save her too. But Aslı first.

35
00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:13.720 line:90%,end
In the fortress tower, Nyra brought Aslı before Sila.

36
00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:18.020 line:90%,end
Well done, my red warrior. Her friends will come for her.

37
00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:20.640 line:90%,end
And I'll be waiting for them.

38
00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:22.140 line:90%,end
As you command.

39
00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:27.220 line:90%,end
But as Nyra left through the door, she glanced into Aslı's eyes for a moment.

40
00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:28.650 line:90%,end
And she hesitated.

41
00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:33.340 line:90%,end
You woke up in a capsule like me, didn't you? They're deceiving you.

42
00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:35.050 line:90%,end
Nyra didn't answer.

43
00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:39.320 line:90%,end
But for the first time, a blue spark flashed in her red eyes.

44
00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:46.040 line:90%,end
And far away, in the mine camp, the crystals on Eray's shoulder were humming a strange song.

45
00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:48.230 line:90%,end
As if they were calling him home.

